<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Why I Like Pirates</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Why I Like Pirates</h1>

    <p>I like pirates because they are interesting and adventurous. 
    I think ships, treasure, and the ocean are really cool. 
    Pirates make history fun to learn about.</p>

    <h2>Pirate Ships</h2>

    <p>I like pirate ships because they look cool and have big sails. 
    I think it would be interesting to see an old pirate ship in real life. 
    I also like how they sailed across the ocean.</p>

    <h2>Pirate Treasure</h2>

    <p>I like learning about pirate treasure because it makes pirates 
    more interesting. I think treasure maps, gold, and hidden islands 
    are really cool. Finding buried treasure would be an awesome adventure.</p>

</body>
</html>